      premises: [],
      foundation: true,
      formula: String.raw`\operatorname{Hom}_{\mathrm{Sch}}(X, \operatorname{Spec} A) \cong \operatorname{Hom}_{\mathrm{Ring}}\big(A, \Gamma(X,\mathcal O_X)\big)`,
